OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in collision between
OL,4,AHGV and bike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was killed in a collision between
OL,7,Fan HGV and a bicycle in Bromsgrove.
OL,9,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said
OL,10,Fthey were called to the junction of New
OL,11,FRoad and the A38 at 15:34 BST on
OL,12,FTuesday.
OL,14,F"On arrival, a man, the cyclist, was
OL,15,Ffound. Sadly, it quickly became
OL,16,Fapparent nothing could be done to save
OL,17,Fhim and he was confirmed dead at the
OL,18,Fscene," a West Midlands Ambulance
OL,19,FService spokeswoman said.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
