OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in collision between
OL,4,AHGV and bike
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Mercia Police have been contacted
OL,7,Ffor comment. The A38 was blocked in
OL,8,Fboth directions between the A448 and
OL,9,FCharford Road on Tuesday evening as a
OL,10,Fresult of the crash. New Road was also
OL,11,Fclosed both ways between Wellington
OL,12,FRoad and Bant Mill Road.
